135
00:08:22,153 --> 00:08:23,200
But what, Giorno?

136
00:08:23,540 --> 00:08:26,957
Are you trying to tell me we have
a long-distance stand on board?

137
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:29,657
You sure you're not just a
little loose in the noodle?

138
00:08:29,740 --> 00:08:32,269
Well, yeah, I suppose
that's a possibility.

139
00:08:32,540 --> 00:08:33,920
But I'm sure.

140
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:36,066
