They're inanimate.

168
00:10:00,260 --> 00:10:01,540
No life whatsoever.

169
00:10:02,780 --> 00:10:04,309
If they were just animate,

170
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:06,397
or even if they were
some sort of new stand,

171
