Golden Wind's power simply wouldn't work.

172
00:10:08,620 --> 00:10:10,557
Plant life would never sprout from them.

173
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:14,277
Look, you guys, I know those multiplying
zombie digits really spooked me out,

174
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,537
but let's be real, shall we?

175
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:17,620
I was probably just seeing things.

176
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:21,997
Even so, why are these stupid freaking
fingers on this stupid freaking plane?

177
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,786
That's what I'd like to know.

178
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:28,220
Someone planted these here, but
the how and who elude us for now.

179
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:31,720
Regardless, they have to go. What?

180
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:33,997
You don't mean off the plane, do you?

181
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:36,297
But you can't open the
door while we're airborne.

182
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:39,577
We'll get sucked out like turds
being flung down the toilet.

183
00:10:39,660 --> 00:10:41,248
Hold on tight to something.

184
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,400
Open her up, Zipperman!

185
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:50,658
Well, the job is finished
and with nary a soul flung.

186
00:10:55,540 --> 00:10:57,137
Make sure there are no more.

187
00:10:57,220 --> 00:10:59,220
Check every crevice of this plane.

188
00:11:07,680 --> 00:11:10,857
Yeah I could go for some pizza too nothing

189
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:14,180
complicated just a pizza
margarita from Napoli

190
00:11:19,300 --> 00:11:21,997
What the heck is this
a train station stall

191
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:25,160
what's with the graffiti
isn't this some rich

192
00:11:42,420 --> 00:11:43,250
guy's plane?

193
00:11:43,333 --> 00:11:44,997
What the hell is going on here?

194
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:48,017
The name of that guy's stand is

195
00:11:48,100 --> 00:11:54,657
Notorious chase who in the hell wrote

196
00:11:54,740 --> 00:12:00,260
this and when what would the Stan
have to gain by doing this what

197
00:12:07,140 --> 00:12:13,377
These fingers no it can't be
Bucciarati just threw them

198
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:17,260
outside we didn't touch Is
this what wrote the graffiti?

199
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,420
Is it a corpse?

200
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:23,950
Impossible!

201
00:12:24,140 --> 00:12:25,460
Its user is dead!

202
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:27,348
So the stand has to be too!

203
00:12:28,820 --> 00:12:29,650
Merida!

204
00:12:29,733 --> 00:12:32,111
It's fading on my body and getting bigger!

205
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:33,600
Golden wind!

206
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:36,060
Pack off my right arm fast!

207
00:12:37,700 --> 00:12:39,140
Wait! What in the hell?

208
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:41,500
It looks exactly like my hand!

209
00:12:42,220 --> 00:12:43,050
Shit!

210
00:12:43,133 --> 00:12:44,292
It's devouring my stand!

211
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:53,497
The one who wrote that
graffiti on the wall?

212
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:55,357
He brought those fingers aboard!

213
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,800
It was me.

214
00:12:58,020 --> 00:12:59,597
What's the problem, Giorno?

215
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:00,510
Hey, you good?

216
00:13:01,220 --> 00:13:02,340
Golden wind.

217
