Yahoo!

218
00:13:09,060 --> 00:13:10,077
Hey, Giorno.

219
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:12,277
You better start making a replacement arm!

220
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:13,220
And quickly.

221
00:13:13,900 --> 00:13:14,980
What the hell?

222
00:13:15,620 --> 00:13:18,500
Did he just try to pounce
on Golden Wind's arm?

223
00:13:18,900 --> 00:13:20,312
What's going on, Giorno?

224
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,740
This is madness!

225
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:24,737
Forget everything you know about stands.

226
00:13:24,820 --> 00:13:26,526
We've never seen this before.

227
00:13:26,760 --> 00:13:30,995
If that aberration is a stand, then
its user has to be hiding somewhere.

228
00:13:32,100 --> 00:13:32,997
