230
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:36,391
Back there on the runway.

231
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:40,537
I knew there was something
weird about the guy.

232
00:13:40,620 --> 00:13:45,267
He approached us so he could die and let
his stand hunt us down from the skies.

233
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:47,357
His essence lives on.

234
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:51,177
It seems being killed triggered
the emergence of his stand.

235
