It has no user, so it can keep up
without being tethered to a person.

236
00:13:56,580 --> 00:13:57,597
Don't you worry.

237
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:59,217
It's as slow as a slug.

238
00:13:59,300 --> 00:14:01,897
Actually, since it's not
moving, you think it's dead.

239
00:14:01,980 --> 00:14:02,837
Has to be.

240
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:05,797
After being blasted, it's not moving.

241
00:14:05,880 --> 00:14:08,337
No. No. Run. Shot.

242
00:14:08,420 --> 00:14:13,660
It's It's feeding, it
doesn't need to move.

243
00:14:14,060 --> 00:14:15,360
I got too close.

244
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:18,060
This bastard is quick.

245
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,980
Damn thing got my bullets.

246
00:14:20,900 --> 00:14:23,580
It got four of them, more than half.

247
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:27,840
Number two, three, six, seven.

248
00:14:28,160 --> 00:14:29,700
It's deadly, damn it.

249
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:31,300
You have to stay away.

250
00:14:32,060 --> 00:14:34,400
Get back, all of you. Mista.

251
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:37,760
Not good, stay back.

252
00:14:38,020 --> 00:14:39,120
What's going on?

253
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:41,624
Why is it going after Narancia?

254
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:45,677
It's got to have some method
of discerning its next victim.

255
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:47,760
Don't you think I'm scared of you?

256
00:14:47,880 --> 00:14:49,939
All I gotta do is keep my distance?

257
00:14:50,260 --> 00:14:54,789
Well then, nice thing is I don't have
to get close to fill you full of holes.

258
00:14:58,300 --> 00:15:00,560
That movement, so I was right.

259
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:02,629
It is detecting something.

260
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,030
Damn it!

261
00:15:09,113 --> 00:15:10,020
It's so fast!

262
00:15:10,260 --> 00:15:12,057
I can't keep up with that speed!

263
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:16,260
At this rate, that meat monster of
a stand is gonna slaughter us all!

264
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:23,040
Narancia! Quick, Trish!

265
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:25,240
Hide in the closet and stay quiet!

266
00:15:31,340 --> 00:15:37,200
What oh no what's it one with
Trish get it and shut the door?

267
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:47,637
I understand I know what it's tracking

268
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:51,217
it's movement moving objects trigger it?

269
00:15:51,300 --> 00:15:52,557
to zero in for the kill.

270
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:54,699
That explains how it's choosing us.

271
00:15:54,900 --> 00:15:56,920
The more swiftly its target moves,

272
00:15:57,100 --> 00:16:00,629
the more voraciously it seeks
to consume its panicking prey.

273
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:13,240
If we can just get this thing off my
left arm, we can all make it to Sardinia.

274
00:16:13,700 --> 00:16:15,740
It's our only option now.

275
00:16:16,020 --> 00:16:18,017
It'll be like this never happened.

276
00:16:18,100 --> 00:16:19,037
Just wait, Giorno!

277
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:19,950
No!

278
00:16:20,033 --> 00:16:21,654
You use your stand to recover injuries!

279
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:24,113
You can't do that if you lose both arms!

280
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:25,680
Make it latch onto me!

281
00:16:25,940 --> 00:16:28,260
I'll deal with it myself! Hurry!

282
00:16:30,460 --> 00:16:32,280
We're out of time, Bucciarati!

283
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:34,541
It's starting to creep up my arm!

284
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:36,910
No!

285
00:16:36,993 --> 00:16:37,940
Don't do it!

286
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:45,040
No, Jean!

287
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,940
We were so close.

288
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:54,917
Sardinia was within reach.

289
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:58,120
Mista and Narancia are…

290
00:16:59,820 --> 00:17:01,857
This isn't happening.

291
00:17:01,940 --> 00:17:04,180
All this happened because of me.

292
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:07,737
Because I decided to bring
my team onto this plane.

293
00:17:07,820 --> 00:17:10,040
I ignored every single pitfall.

294
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:11,940
This is my mistake to own.

295
00:17:12,940 --> 00:17:16,280
No one could have
anticipated this. No one.

296
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:19,997
Being on this plane
granted us the opportunity

297
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:22,433
to rid ourselves of that stand for good.

298
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:27,157
We have to do something
about their injuries.

299
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,117
They're serious.

300
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:30,537
They can start recovering in the turtle.

301
00:17:30,620 --> 00:17:32,780
Hang on, about their injuries.

302
00:17:33,420 --> 00:17:34,997
I need you to tell me the truth.

303
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:37,560
His arms, they can be replaced.

304
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:39,400
Isn't that right?

305
00:17:39,900 --> 00:17:42,782
His stand, Golden Wind,
has the power to do that?

306
00:17:44,380 --> 00:17:47,717
Golden Wind and Zipperman
can only actuate their powers

307
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:50,741
through direct contact
with their hands and fists.

308
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:55,740
Neither of us have ever suffered
damage like this before.

309
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:59,057
Giorno Giovanna is out of commission.

310
00:17:59,140 --> 00:18:02,260
Which means, so are Mista and Arantxa.

311
00:18:03,100 --> 00:18:06,000
Giorno has no way of
regenerating his arms.

312
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:11,040
Trish, you should get some rest.

313
00:18:11,700 --> 00:18:14,759
I'll bring a Bacchio up to
speed on what's happened.

314
00:18:25,220 --> 00:18:26,050
I'm...

315
00:18:26,133 --> 00:18:28,540
I'm traveling to Sardinia
for my own benefit.

316
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:33,240
For me, and me alone.

317
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:40,057
All of this bloodshed due to me
wanting to learn about my father.

318
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:42,680
Only because it serves my interests.

319
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:47,713
But Giorno and the others are different.

320
00:18:48,740 --> 00:18:50,797
They're not concerned
about their own safety.

321
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:54,233
They're fighting for what they
believe is right and just.

322
00:18:56,460 --> 00:18:57,420
As I am.

323
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:00,939
I don't think I could ever do that.

324
00:19:16,260 --> 00:19:18,380
Was that a ball?

325
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,540
Why is a ball out there?

326
00:20:01,540 --> 00:20:02,599
What in the world?

327
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:06,476
How the hell was it not sent
flying from the airplane?

328
00:20:07,120 --> 00:20:09,360
Wait, of course it didn't fly away.

329
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:10,750
Journal.

330
00:20:11,320 --> 00:20:12,200
It's movement.

331
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:15,197
Moving objects trigger it
to zero in for the kill.

332
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:17,339
That explains how it's choosing us.

333
00:20:18,340 --> 00:20:20,987
We're flying through
the air at a high speed.

334
00:20:21,700 --> 00:20:24,524
It's drawn to whatever
object is moving fastest.

335
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:28,593
That would certainly explain
why it went after the knife.

336
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:35,137
I've got to get into the
closet and shut the door now.

337
00:20:35,220 --> 00:20:39,177
Slowly, I have to move slowly.

338
00:20:39,260 --> 00:20:41,857
Slow but with purpose.

339
00:20:41,940 --> 00:20:46,560
I can detect anything.

340
00:21:01,180 --> 00:21:03,617
Why'd it change direction all of a sudden?

341
00:21:03,700 --> 00:21:05,524
Something must have set it off.

342
00:21:10,900 --> 00:21:12,460
That's Giorno's brooch?

343
00:21:13,260 --> 00:21:15,640
C-could it be alive?

344
00:21:18,320 --> 00:21:19,967
Golden wind is transforming.

345
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:22,920
Is it turning into Giorno's arms?

346
00:21:23,360 --> 00:21:24,580
His left hand.

347
00:21:25,760 --> 00:21:26,957
I can't believe it.

348
00:21:27,040 --> 00:21:28,980
It's forming a brand new hand!

349
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:32,209
Before he severed his arm,

350
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:34,617
Giorno had already begun
growing a replacement.

351
00:21:34,700 --> 00:21:37,680
by infusing the ladybug
with life-giving energy.

352
00:21:39,820 --> 00:21:42,457
Giorno's not going down
without a hell of a fight!

353
00:21:42,540 --> 00:21:45,017
As long as I keep that
thing away from his hand,

354
00:21:45,100 --> 00:21:47,394
Narancia and Mista might have a chance!

355
00:21:48,480 --> 00:21:50,380
But how the hell do I do that?

356
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:02,057
They were accusing.

357
00:22:02,140 --> 00:22:04,117
They've always been knowing.

358
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:06,417
What is just fiction?

359
00:22:06,500 --> 00:22:08,437
Or what is the truth?

360
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:10,537
They have a mission.

361
00:22:10,620 --> 00:22:12,517
They are the question.

362
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:14,937
But they dare to tell us.

363
00:22:15,020 --> 00:22:16,717
What's bad and what's good?

364
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:18,137
Stand up!

365
00:22:18,220 --> 00:22:20,257
Join us!

366
00:22:20,340 --> 00:22:22,157
Come on!

367
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:23,097
Just say this!

368
00:22:23,180 --> 00:22:26,097
We are the power!

369
00:22:26,180 --> 00:22:28,277
We'll see the future!

370
00:22:28,360 --> 00:22:31,297
As we are fighters!

371
00:22:31,380 --> 00:22:34,400
Just fighting for a ride.

372
00:23:56,180 --> 00:23:57,980
Thank you.
